  "_comment": "Stockists for the Where to Find map. Hand-maintained — unlike the rest of data/, this file is NOT produced by `npm run scrape`: the live site's locator was Storemapper, which served its list from its own API. `npm run db:seed` upserts these on (name, address), so editing a row here and re-seeding updates it in place rather than duplicating. Rows added through /admin/locations are left untouched.",
  "_coordinates": "lat/lng for the 13 active rows were read from the `ll=` parameter of the Storemapper share links, which is the map centre at z=12 rather than the geocoded pin — spot-checked against the addresses it sits within roughly 200m. Run `npm run geocode` once a Google Maps key is in .env to replace them with exact geocoded positions.",
